---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Vanish (Firefox Add-on)"
  description="Privacy Policy for the Vanish Firefox Add-on."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="privacy-page">
    <div class="container container-readable">
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy for Vanish (Firefox Add-on)</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> July 27, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <section class="prose">
        <p>
          Vanish is built with user privacy as a core requirement. This Privacy Policy outlines how data is handled by the Firefox Add-on.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">1. Zero Data Collection</h3>
        <p>
          Vanish does <strong>NOT</strong> collect, log, store, transmit, or sell any personal data, browsing history, user credentials, or IP addresses to any external server or third party.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="subsection-title">2. Mozilla Data Collection Disclosure</h3>
        <p>
          In accordance with Mozilla's Add-on Policies, Vanish explicitly declares:
        </p>
        <pre><code>"data_collection_permissions": &#123; "required": ["none"] &#125;</code></pre>
        <p>
          The add-on requires no personal data to function and collects zero user data.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">3. Local Firefox Storage Only</h3>
        <p>
          Your preferences (such as idle delay time, theme mode, and custom domain list) are saved locally using Firefox's native <code>browser.storage.sync</code> API. This data stays entirely within your local browser profile or Firefox Sync account.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">4. No External Requests or Trackers</h3>
        <p>
          Vanish operates completely offline inside your browser. It contains zero analytics, tracking scripts, or external network requests.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">5. Contact Information</h3>
        <p>
          If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Developer:</strong> Mateus Tavares</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:me@mattavares.com">me@mattavares.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://mattavares.com/contact/">https://mattavares.com/contact/</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 0 5rem 0;
  }

  .container-readable {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .prose {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .prose ul {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .prose pre {
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .prose code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  /* Inline code block styling */
  .prose p code {
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--brand-sage);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .prose a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .subsection-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--brand-sage);
  }
</style>
